          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses said, “Thus says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": About midnight I will go forth in the midst of Egypt; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and all the first-born in the land of Egypt shall die, from the first-born of Pharaoh who sits upon his throne, even to the first-born of the maidservant who is behind the mill; and all the first-born of the cattle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And there shall be a great cry throughout all the land of Egypt, such as there has never been, nor ever shall be again. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But against any of the people of Israel, either man or beast, not a dog shall growl; that you may know that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " makes a distinction between the Egyptians and Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And all these your servants shall come down to me, and bow down to me, saying, ‘Get you out, and all the people who follow you.’ And after that I will go out.” And he went out from Pharaoh in hot anger. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Pharaoh will not listen to you; that my wonders may be multiplied in the land of Egypt.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
